WEBVTT

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.880
The waves are strong! Put your backs into
rowing so we aren't carried away!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.010
The wind is also a bit strong.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.220
We number 3,000! They have only 1,000.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.050
We Genji have the advantage!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.230
We Heike surpass them in fighting at sea!

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.560
Do not falter!

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.120
Shoot!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.330
Shoot!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:21.220
THE HEIKE STORY

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.470
Episode 11

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.430
A shrike?

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:47.060
It is an adorable bird, but they say
it impales its prey on branches.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.570
I imagine that about now,

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:54.400
the Genji warriors are meeting the
Heike warriors with the same fate.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.450
What clear skies!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:08.000
Perhaps a sign that the Sacred
Treasures shall return to the capital.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.510
Board their boat!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.850
We, too, shall follow Lord Tomomori!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.070
Push on my command!

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.190
Don't push!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.320
I'm gonna fall!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.900
Ready, push!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.460
Do not falter! Row like mad!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.630
Force them into the whirlpool!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.440
The tide is with us!

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.440
Attack! Attack!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.570
How do things look?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.240
We have the advantage.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.080
Hand me a bow!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.260
Mother, I wish to see the battle.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.180
It is too dangerous.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.970
But I wish to see it!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.020
You can see it if you won't cry
should an arrow strike you.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.230
It's no fun to be in pain.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.530
That's it.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.990
Keep going! Crush the Genji!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.580
Here we go!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.550
Lord Yoshitsune, our boats
cannot advance in these currents!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.630
It may be best to retreat.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.180
We possess superior numbers.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.010
In time, the Heike forces should tire.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.390
Ride it out, my lord!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:40.780
What's this?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:51.660
What is that?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.250
They're...

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.930
Dolphins?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.560
Lord Munemori!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.180
According to the <i>onmyoji</i>,

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.980
if those dolphins swim to the Genji side,
the Genji shall fall.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.570
But if they continue on to our side...

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.360
This feels like old times.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.500
Our banners...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.790
The winds have shifted...

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.130
Stay away! Stay away!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.050
Stay away!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.730
This hairstyle looks good on you.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.530
The wind favors us!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.160
Shoot their rowers with arrows!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.120
Shoot their rowers!

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.040
Shoot their rowers!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.920
We're being swept back!

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.850
The current has shifted! Push them back!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.320
Lord Tomomori!

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:47.530
Lord Yoshitsune!
There are boats approaching!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:52.330
Lord Yoshitsune!
We have come to aid the Genji!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:58.330
The momentum is ours! Attack! Attack!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.720
This is bad! I'm going to Mother's boat!

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.610
Lord Munemori!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.950
Munemori, what is the situation?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.950
I-It is still uncertain.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.630
Brother.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:45.800
What happens to the emperor
if we should lose?

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:50.970
The emperor would probably
be taken to the capital

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:55.140
to conduct a formal abdication
to Emperor Go-Toba.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.560
So his life will be spared.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.100
But then...

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:02.400
...all our efforts to protect the emperor
and the Sacred Treasures

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.150
would be meaningless!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.820
Mother.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:09.030
To hand either over at this point...

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.240
Then what was the point
of all our drifting?

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.120
Of all that we endured?

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.120
I said the outcome is not yet certain!

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.790
Survival is hollow.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.580
What awaits is a life more
miserable than this one.

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:29.630
The answer is clear.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.510
Mother!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:38.010
How will the emperor be treated
once robbed of his position?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:44.690
And you. If captured, you may well
be forcibly married to some Genji.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:46.770
Do you still insist you
can protect the emperor?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:52.820
Lord Yoshitsune, the emperor
is not on a Chinese ship.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.620
One who switched sides
from the Heike has informed us.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.160
I see.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.330
Listen well!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:04.000
The emperor is not on a Chinese ship!
Attack the small boats!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:11.970
Lord Tomomori, they have begun
attacking the small boats!

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.380
Who has betrayed us?

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.680
Lord Tomomori...

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.390
So this is the end...

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.770
Head for Tokuko's boat!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.650
Lord Tomomori!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.990
Oh, Tomomori! You're safe!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.360
Brother.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:39.910
Mother...

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.330
What of the battle?

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:02.180
You ladies will soon behold
a rare sight: men from the east!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.270
What is going on?

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.690
I will not be taken by the enemy.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.370
Come, Emperor.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.920
Where do you mean to take me?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.500
A beautiful place called
the Pure Land paradise.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.800
Mother...

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.890
Bring forth the Treasures.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:43.390
I shall go buy you some time.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.540
There! That's the boat!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:39.780
♪ The little emperor,
in dark green imperial robes, ♪

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:44.490
♪ Hair tied in loops at his temples, ♪

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.790
♪ tears welling in his eyes, ♪

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:54.920
♪ Pressed his small,
delicate hands together ♪

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.840
♪ And first prayed eastward. ♪

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:08.560
♪ Afterwards he turned west
and recited the <i>nenbutsu</i>. ♪

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:13.020
♪ Before long, the Lady Nun
took him in her arms. ♪

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:19.610
♪ "There is a capital beneath the waves,
too!" she said to comfort him. ♪

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.620
♪ Oh, how sad that the spring
breeze of impermanence ♪

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:34.210
♪ so quickly scatters
the flower's petals. ♪

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:40.590
♪ Oh, how pitiful that the rough
waves of life and death ♪

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:45.720
♪ sank his personage beneath them. ♪

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.450
Tokuko!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.700
Tokuko!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.840
Tokuko!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.430
Not yet. Your story isn't over.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.350
Empress Dowager!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.730
What?!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.320
That was His Majesty's mother!

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.570
Quickly! Pull her up!

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.780
I have Her Majesty!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.620
No!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.750
Do not touch me!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.830
Tokuko!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.750
Tokuko, it is not your time!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.050
Your future continues!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:05.260
No! Let me go with them!

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:08.010
This eye sees the future!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:11.430
You continue to live for everyone's sake.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.900
This eye I inherited from Shigemori!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:23.860
I see them, Tokuko! Everyone.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:29.870
The emperor's... little hands...
are pressed together.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.500
And the emperor?

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.800
I'm afraid he...

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:45.420
I see...

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.980
I have seen all that I must.

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.030
My word...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.450
Follow me, all who hold
the Heike name dear!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.340
<i>Namu Amida Bu.</i>

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:02.770
You were once an emperor's wife.
For you to live in such a shabby place...

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:06.400
Do you not feel constricted?

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:10.150
At one time I did feel that way.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:15.870
However, this too is a welcome occurrence
for my passage into the afterlife.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:17.620
That is how I feel about it now.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:25.960
I was born Taira no Kiyomori's daughter,
became the emperor's wife,

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:28.040
bore His Majesty's child,

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:34.760
enjoyed the beauty of the passing seasons,
knowing neither hunger nor cold...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:38.680
To be placed in such glory and prosperity,

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:42.180
it felt as if I were in heaven.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:50.780
I fled the capital, my clan
spent the days in battle,

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:53.740
and while at sea I could
not even drink water.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:58.620
All living things must perish.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:02.250
I even saw my child's life
extinguish before my eyes...

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:11.710
I have been put through every form
of suffering in the human world.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.430
There is not a single one
I do not understand.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:23.930
I... wished to claim the Sacred Treasures,
not your whole clan's lives...

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.730
Your Majesty,

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:31.690
there is apparently a Dragon Palace
Castle at the bottom of the sea.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:36.070
I have dreamt of it.

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.740
My lady.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:43.330
I hope this is to your liking.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.420
This is delicious!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.380
I am glad to hear that.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.810
How can one overcome suffering?

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.480
Pray.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.520
I too have feelings I still cannot forget.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.990
And so I simply,

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.740
I simply press my hands together and pray.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:24.490
I think of the ones I love, and I pray for
their happiness in the next world.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:28.540
That small act is what I can do.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.710
And the person who taught me that

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:40.010
is also praying for the Heike,
and passing down our story.

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:48.560
Our clan shall live on in that story.

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.730
That story begins like this:

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.700
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message...

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.960
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message...

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:16.420
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message...

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:20.090
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message...

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:25.100
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message...

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:35.570
The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.320
that all existence is impermanent.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.740
The sal tree's blossoms
turn white to grieve him:

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.540
a reminder that all
who flourish must fall.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:59.380
Indulgence does not last.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.840
It shall but be like a
spring night's dream.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.100
The dauntless shall meet their end.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:19.150
They shall be as mere
dust before the wind.
